    <div class="stop-row">📒 Late Gothic Revival manor on the seafront, given to town in 1930. Inside: 25,000-volume library, 16th-century illuminated text, Moorish tile panels, silver from two centuries. The park — lake, peacocks, shaded path — is free to enter.</div>
    <div class="stop-row">📖 <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Condes_de_Castro_Guimar%C3%A3es_Museum" target="_blank">Wikipedia</a></div>
