    <div class="stop-row">📒 Modern marina opened in 1999 with around 650 berths, ringed by a horseshoe of restaurants, gelato counters, and bars beneath a replica-fort façade. The flat quayside promenade is the easiest stroll in town — sailboats on one side, the open bay on the other.</div>
