    <div class="stop-row">📒 A fortress begun in the 15th century to guard the bay, later a royal summer residence. Its walls now enclose the Bairro dos Museus art district — galleries, artists' studios, a design hotel, and quiet cobbled lanes that open onto the sea wall and the marina below.</div>
