    <!-- tour-search: 0 qualifying — no guided tours of the municipal park; ships self-walk through the gardens -->
    <div class="stop-header"><span class="stop-num">4.</span> <span class="stop-name self">Parque Marechal Carmona</span></div>
    <div class="stop-row">📒 The town's green lungs beside the Castro Guimarães museum — broad lawns, shaded gravel paths, a duck pond, roaming peacocks, and a casual garden café. A favourite local spot for families and the easiest place to slow down before heading back to the hotel.</div>
    <div class="tour-box">
      <div>🏛️ Daily 9:00am - 8:00pm</div>
      <div>⏰ ~1h</div>
      <div class="tour-meet"><div>📍 <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Parque+Marechal+Carmona+Avenida+da+Republica+2750-475+Cascais+Portugal" target="_blank">Parque Marechal Carmona</a></div></div>
